==Restrictions==
Rarity: Only [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal]], [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare]] and [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare]]

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kano & Souma (Enemy)|Kano & Souma]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
**1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A rather difficult stage due to the restrictions and the high magnifications on the enemies. Cats that deal high amounts of damage can be extremely helpful in this stage. The only enemies that appear for an unlimited amount of time are B.B.Bunny and Ginger Snache; all others only appear once or twice. If you're nervous about dying to the Level 2 [[Wave Attack]] that Kano & Souma create then any units that are [[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|Immune to waves]] can help deal with them.

